SCOPE — what this licence does and does not cover
================================================================================

The MIT licence above applies to the SOURCE CODE in this repository only.

It does NOT apply to the images, branding or written content, none of which are
the copyright holder's to license. Specifically excluded:

  CU Urdu Soc Logo.png        The society's logo and wordmark. Property of the
  public/logo.png             Cambridge University Urdu Society.
  src/app/icon*.png
  src/app/apple-icon.png
  src/app/opengraph-image.png

  public/su-logo.svg          Stand-in for the Cambridge SU logo. Property of
                              Cambridge SU; not the society's to sublicense.

  public/term-cards/*.jpg     Society term cards. Property of the society and
                              of whoever designed them.

  attachments/                Material left by previous committees, kept as
                              reference. Property of its authors.

Any photographs later uploaded through /admin/gallery likewise belong to the
people who took them and are not covered.

Urdu verse quoted in the site content (in src/lib/content.ts, and in the
database seed) is quoted for the society's own use. Where a poet is still in
copyright, reuse is the reuser's responsibility to clear.

If you reuse this code — and you are welcome to — replace the society's name,
logo, term cards and quoted verse with your own before deploying it.
